{"seq":1,"slug":"inventing-management","title":"Inventing Management","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/peter-drucker/core-contributions/inventing-management","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-father-of-modern-management","title":"现代管理学之父","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/peter-drucker/core-contributions/inventing-management/the-father-of-modern-management","wordCount":1998,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"management-as-a-discipline","title":"管理作为一门学科","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/peter-drucker/core-contributions/inventing-management/management-as-a-discipline","wordCount":1654,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<p>本章呈现德鲁克作为&quot;现代管理学之父&quot;的根本贡献。他第一个将&quot;管理&quot;确立为一门独立的、系统的学科，开创了现代管理学；他将管理提升为一门可研究、可传授、可学习的学科，为现代管理教育奠定了基础；他极大地提升了&quot;管理&quot;在现代社会中的地位。本章还揭示了他如何系统地界定管理的本质、任务（三大任务）与普遍适用性。本章揭示德鲁克奠定现代管理学的崇高地位。</p>\n"}